msgid "Poll votes"
msgstr "票數"

msgid "The number of votes that have been cast on a poll."
msgstr "總共投票數"

msgid "Poll winner"
msgstr "投票勝出者"

msgid "The winning poll answer."
msgstr "投票勝出之答案。"

msgid "Poll winner votes"
msgstr "投票勝出者票數"

msgid "The number of votes received by the winning poll answer."
msgstr "投票勝出者所取得的投票數。"

msgid "Poll winner percent"
msgstr "投票勝出者百分比"

msgid "The percentage of votes received by the winning poll answer."
msgstr "投票勝出者所取得百分比。"

msgid "Poll duration"
msgstr "投票期間"

msgid "The length of time the poll is set to run."
msgstr "設定的投票時間長度"

msgid "About"
msgstr "關於"

msgid "The Poll module can be used to create simple surveys or questionnaires that display cumulative results. A poll is a good way to receive feedback from site users and community members. For more information, see the online handbook entry for the <a href=\":poll\">Poll module</a>."
msgstr "「問卷調查」模組可用來建立簡式意見調查或問卷，以顯示累積結果。問卷調查是一種接收網站使用者和社群成員意見的好方法。如需相關資訊，請參閱線上手冊項目：<a href=\":poll\">「問卷調查」模組</a>。"

msgid "Uses"
msgstr "使用"

msgid "Creating a poll"
msgstr "建立投票"

msgid "Users can create a poll by clicking on <a href=\":add-poll\">Add a poll</a> on the <a href=\":polls\">Polls</a> page, and entering the question being posed, the answer choices, and beginning vote counts for each choice. The status (closed or active) and duration (length of time the poll remains active for new votes) can also be specified."
msgstr "使用者可以建立問卷調查，方式是按一下<a href=\":polls\">問卷調查</a>頁面上的<a href=\":add-poll\">新增問卷調查</a>，輸入要提出的問題和答案選項，然後開始統計每一個選項的投票數。同時還可以指定狀態（已關閉或作用中）及持續時間（問卷調查在新投票中保持作用中的時間長度）。"

msgid "Viewing polls"
msgstr "檢視投票"

msgid "You can visit the <a href=\":polls\">Polls</a> page to view all current polls, or alternately enable the <em>Most recent poll</em> block on the <a href=\":blocks\">Blocks administration page</a>. To vote in or view the results of a specific poll, you can click on the poll itself."
msgstr "您可以造訪<a href=\":polls\">問卷調查</a>頁面來檢視所有現行問卷調查，或者，在<a href=\":blocks\">區塊管理頁面</a>上啟用<em>最新問卷調查</em>區塊。若要對特定問卷調查進行投票或檢視其投票結果，您可以按一下問卷調查本身。"

msgid "Vote form/Results"
msgstr "投票表單/結果"

msgid "Vote form of the poll or the results depending on current user."
msgstr "問卷調查的投票表單或結果取決於現行使用者。"

msgid "Results"
msgstr "結果"

msgid "Poll"
msgstr "投票"

msgid "Allows your site to capture votes on different topics in the form of multiple choice questions."
msgstr "讓您的網站可以用複選問題來針對不同的主題進行投票。"

